                                "sense_id": "6dc1a66f-373a-3f29-9a13-515b421336c0",
                                "text": "The purpose of this paper is to develop a complete and general theory of aperture referral in linear optics for dioptric systems that may be heterocentric and astigmatic. Apertures may be elliptical and decentred. Referral transforms the geometry of an aperture."
