                                "sense_id": "2904ea3e-d4d7-3b61-94f1-67fa98732a35",
                                "text": "The satisfaction one desires from the action is due either to the value which the action has directly for the doer or to the value which it has in producing satisfaction in others. The active attitude, then, is either egocentric or heterocentric."
